      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#DB2777;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">b · 镜面/高反光</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">  [B, 1, H, W]  ∈ [0,1]</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-family:Calibri">  网络估计的“被叠加上去的高光”</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:5px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#1E2761;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">r_direct · 直接漫反射</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">  [B, 1, H, W]  ∈ [0,1]</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-family:Calibri">  解码器直接预测的去高光图</span></p><p><span style="color:#000000;font-size:5px;font-family:Calibri"> </span></p><p><span style="color:#F59E0B;font-size:12px;font-family:Calibri;font-weight:700">alpha_logit</span><span style="color:#1F2937;font-size:11px;font-family:Consolas">  标量或可广播张量 (未 sigmoid)</span></p><p><span style="color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-family:Calibri">  下一步 α = sigmoid(alpha_logit) ∈ [0,1] 作融合系数</span></p>
    sourceLayout: cd2c55cef098d5dc840d1ff6ab7f45c29c6e9fa55e1d28ccc8dc837089756b97
